  Title: Scientists just cracked the hidden rules of cancer evolution
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260125083344.htm
  category: research
  importance: 92
  ai_summary: "Researchers have identified the hidden rules governing chromosome gains and losses in cancer cells, revealing how tumors evolve and adapt to treatment. This understanding could lead to more targeted therapies."
  
  Title: Brain waves could help paralyzed patients move again
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260124073926.htm
  category: research
  importance: 90
  ai_summary: "A brain-computer interface system utilizing EEG signals can potentially translate paralyzed patients' intentions into movement via spinal stimulation, though finer motor control remains a challenge. This demonstrates promising advancements in neurorehabilitation."
  
  Title: The hidden health impact of growing up with ADHD traits
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260124073920.htm
  category: research
  importance: 88
  ai_summary: "A long-term study links childhood ADHD traits to an increased risk of multiple physical health problems and disability in midlife, highlighting the far-reaching consequences of neurodevelopmental conditions."
  
  Title: Scientists call for urgent action as dangerous amoebas spread globally
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260124003856.htm
  category: research
  importance: 85
  ai_summary: "Free-living amoebae, capable of surviving harsh conditions and harboring dangerous bacteria, are spreading globally, posing a growing public health threat with potential for severe infections."
  
